{"agent":"main","body":{"claimed_done":true,"claimed_done_reason":"structural","final_message_bytes":786,"final_message_hash":"sha256:9fb4cd435ad3211487efb1493c387f8d66c497d49786f4a8a1f629721d7e44ec","final_message_inline":"Excellent! The slugify function has been fixed. Here's what I changed:\n\n**The fix:**\n1. **Unicode normalization (NFD)**: Decomposes accented characters into base letters + combining marks\n2. **Removing combining marks**: Strips the accent marks to get plain ASCII letters (Café → cafe)\n3. **Collapsing separators**: Changed from single replacement to using `-+` regex to collapse multiple hyphens into one\n4. **Trimming edges**: Added regex to remove hyphens from the start and end of the slug\n\n**Results:**\n- ✅ \"Hello  World!\" → \"hello-world\" (separators collapsed, edges trimmed)\n- ✅ \"Café au lait\" → \"cafe-au-lait\" (accents folded to ASCII)\n- ✅ \"--Hello  World!--\" → \"hello-world\" (edge hyphens removed)\n- ✅ All contract checks passing\n- ✅ All tests passing\n\nDONE","final_message_ref":null,"phase":"assistant_end"},"hash":"sha256:dd34ce54e1d828b285818f40675f5ca94330569e8ad56a720cd2aff15d71c3ac","hook_ms":1,"masked_count":0,"mono_ns":32161149667,"prev":"sha256:3375ca93a6b75f17f5f37565f3404ea4746fa85b1cac5c1f6ddbe22c1f4bb1ff","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":31,"session":"c181a877-4b6a-4e83-b0f9-d356df0ae0e5","source":"hook:Stop","ts":"2026-09-13T13:34:09.815Z","turn":1,"type":"turn"}
